&lt;h2>Power Toys&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="power-toys">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#power-toys" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Power toys are useful utilities provided by Microsoft. You can install them from winget:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code">
&lt;div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-powershell" data-lang="powershell">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">winget&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">install&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">-e&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">-id&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">Microsoft&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">PowerToys&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0">
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
>
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4">&lt;/div>
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4">&lt;/div>
&lt;/button>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>
&lt;p>Or directly from &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/powertoys/"target="_blank" rel="noopener">here&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>It includes utilities such as:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>PowerToys Run: Quick launcher similar to &lt;strong>macOS Spotlight&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Awake: Prevent your computer from going to sleep or turning off the screen&lt;/li>
&lt;li>FancyZones: Advanced window manager to &lt;strong>create custom window layouts&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>PowerRename: &lt;strong>Bulk renaming&lt;/strong> of files with advanced options&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Always on Top: Pin windows to &lt;strong>stay on top&lt;/strong> of others&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Color Picker: &lt;strong>Pick colors&lt;/strong> from anywhere on the screen&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Workspace: Manage &lt;strong>virtual desktops&lt;/strong> easily&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>And many more!&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Old context menu&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="old-context-menu">&lt;/span>
